OL,3,GNEWSA'Stunning' former Tesco building
OL,4,Ato become flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former department store and Tesco
OL,7,Fwill be turned into city centre flats
OL,8,Fafter plans for a hotel were dropped.
OL,10,FSince the supermarket closed in May
OL,11,F2022, the building on Guildhall Hill in
OL,12,FNorwich has stood empty.
OL,14,FPlanning permission had been secured to
OL,15,Fturn it into a hotel ` possibly a
OL,16,FTravelodge ` but earlier this year it
OL,17,Fwas bought by developers ALB Group,
OL,18,Fwhich said it wanted to convert the
OL,19,F"stunning building" into apartments.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
