OL,3,GNEWSA'Stunning' former Tesco building
OL,4,Ato become flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe city council has now approved
OL,7,Fproposals for 28 flats, with the ground
OL,8,Ffloor set to remain as a retail space.
